<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106218" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wet, mositen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				335d
			</span></i>; of a river, <i>water</i> a country, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				226
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέφαρον ὑ. δάκρυσιν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				673
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγαῖς οὐχ ὑγραίνουσιν πόδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					367
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of water, <i>collect in pools,</i> and of solids,
				<i>to be liquefied,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				382b28
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηραίνεσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				653b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				557b11
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑγρανθὲν
			[μέρος</span>] the part which <i>is liquefied,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				51b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>relax</i> the bowels, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.20
			</span></i>.</div>
